{"event":"step_update","step_update":{"conversation_id":"fb370006-9e1d-4d03-bbe9-0c4e4b46c876","step_index":24,"state":"DONE","step_type":"tool","tool_name":"run_command","duration_seconds":1.370933,"tool_info":{"name":"run_command","parameters":{"CommandLine":"git status \u0026\u0026 git diff"},"output":"On branch main\r\nChanges not staged for commit:\r\n  (use \"git add \u003cfile\u003e...\" to update what will be committed)\r\n  (use \"git restore \u003cfile\u003e...\" to discard changes in working directory)\r\n\tmodified:   Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist\r\n\tmodified:   bin/nightly-review.zsh\r\n\r\nUntracked files:\r\n  (use \"git add \u003cfile\u003e...\" to include in what will be committed)\r\n\tANSWER.md\r\n\r\nno changes added to commit (use \"git add\" and/or \"git commit -a\")\r\ndiff --git a/Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist b/Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist\r\nindex c347363..d49eacf 100644\r\n--- a/Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist\r\n+++ b/Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist\r\n@@ -24,6 +24,8 @@\r\n   \u003cdict\u003e\r\n     \u003ckey\u003ePATH\u003c/key\u003e\r\n     \u003cstring\u003e/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin\u003c/string\u003e\r\n+    \u003ckey\u003eUSER\u003c/key\u003e\r\n+    \u003cstring\u003evk\u003c/string\u003e\r\n   \u003c/dict\u003e\r\n \u003c/dict\u003e\r\n \u003c/plist\u003e\r\ndiff --git a/bin/nightly-review.zsh b/bin/nightly-review.zsh\r\nindex e0b986f..d3be732 100755\r\n--- a/bin/nightly-review.zsh\r\n+++ b/bin/nightly-review.zsh\r\n@@ -15,12 +15,15 @@ Do not modify any file.\"\r\n \r\n cd \"$REPO\" || { \"$NOTIFY\" \"nightly review: repo missing\"; exit 1; }\r\n \r\n-claude -p \"$PROMPT\" --output-format text \u003e \"$OUT\"\r\n-status=$?\r\n+SECONDS=0\r\n+claude -p \"$PROMPT\" --output-format text \u003c /dev/null \u003e \"$OUT\"\r\n+rc=$?\r\n+duration=$SECONDS\r\n+print -u2 \"$(date +%FT%T) nightly-review finished in ${duration}s (