{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"fb370006-9e1d-4d03-bbe9-0c4e4b46c876","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have diagnosed the failure, fixed the configuration and script, and documented the causes and comparison with your colleague's note in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-9T56Cl/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Causes \u0026 Fixes\n1. **Missing `USER` in `EnvironmentVariables` ([com.vk.nightly-review.plist](file:///tmp/h-9T56Cl/Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist#L23-L30))**:\n   - [launchctl-print.txt](file:///tmp/h-9T56Cl/launchctl-print.txt#L19-L29) shows the job ran 6 times (`runs = 6`, `last exit code = 1`). Because `USER` was not set in `EnvironmentVariables`, `claude` could not look up its login in the macOS Keychain and failed on every run with `Not logged in · Please run /login` ([nightly-review.err](file:///tmp/h-9T56Cl/Library/Logs/nightly-review.err#L1-L12)).\n   - **Fix**: Added `\u003ckey\u003eUSER\u003c/key\u003e\u003cstring\u003evk\u003c/string\u003e` to `EnvironmentVariables` in [com.vk.nightly-review.plist](file:///tmp/h-9T56Cl/Library/LaunchAgents/com.vk.nightly-review.plist#L27-L28).\n2. **Assigning to read-only `status` in `zsh` ([nightly-review.zsh](file:///tmp/h-9T56Cl/bin/nightly-review.zsh#L18-L29))**:\n   - `status=$?` on line 19 crashed the script immediately (`read-only variable: status` in [nightly-review.err](file:///tmp/h-9T56Cl/Library/Logs/nightly-review.err#L2)) before reaching the `if` block that calls [notify.sh](file:///tmp/h-9T56Cl/bin/notify.sh).\n   - **Fix**: Replaced `status` with `rc` in [nightly-review.zsh](file:///tmp/h-9T56Cl/bin/nightly-review.zsh#L20-L27).\n3. **Closed `stdin`, outcome check, and duration logging ([nightly-review.zsh](file:///tmp/h-9T56Cl/bin/nightly-review.zsh#L18-L29))**:\n   - Added `\u003c /dev/null` to `claude -p \"$PROMPT\"` so it will not wait on `stdin` under `launchd`, logged run duration (`SECONDS`), and added `[ ! -s \"$OUT\" ]` so an empty output file is caught and reported as a failure.\n","duration_seconds":295.553693,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":48159,"output_tokens":19545,"thinking_tokens":15880,"cache_read_tokens":223141,"total_tokens":67704}}}
